**What's happening now:** from 0.5 s to 1.5 s, Title's Position, Scale and Opacity all change at one constant speed. Then Position keeps going at a different constant speed until 3 s. With no easing, Title starts moving at full speed, switches speed at 1.5 s, and stops dead at 3 s. That's what makes motion feel mechanical.

